55
00:04:33,090 --> 00:04:38,070
It's how many people viewed only one page of a website.

56
00:04:38,490 --> 00:04:41,340
Let's have a look at these sentences.

57
00:04:41,610 --> 00:04:45,540
This website has 20,000 users.

58
00:04:45,660 --> 00:04:49,140
This website has many users.

59
00:04:49,380 --> 00:04:52,620
My website has only 20 users.

60
00:04:52,620 --> 00:04:55,920
My website has few users.

61
00:04:55,920 --> 00:04:58,560
User is countable noun.

62
00:04:58,560 --> 00:05:01,530
We can count one user two users.

63
00:05:01,530 --> 00:05:07,110
So we use many and few with users.

64
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:09,920
More examples.

65
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:14,900
The session duration on this website is five minutes.

66
00:05:15,020 --> 00:05:19,520
Users spend much time on this website.

67
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:25,250
The session duration on my site is only 20 seconds.

68
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:29,870
Users spend little time on my website.

69
00:05:29,900 --> 00:05:39,950
Time is uncountable, so to show quantity we use much, much time or little little time.

70
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:51,550
Okay, let's have a look at this sentences and decide if underlined words are countable or uncountable.

71
00:05:51,640 --> 00:05:55,180
Many shops have e-commerce websites.

72
00:05:55,210 --> 00:05:57,700
Many shops, shops.

73
00:05:57,820 --> 00:06:02,200
Countable people spend much money online.

74
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,370
We can see much.

75
00:06:03,370 --> 00:06:06,550
That means money is uncountable.

76
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:10,630
Charity websites have few visitors.

77
00:06:10,660 --> 00:06:16,960
Few used with countable visitors is a countable noun.

78
00:06:17,140 --> 00:06:22,090
All the people have little knowledge about online shopping.

79
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:26,110
Little so knowledge is uncountable.

80
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:33,970
Okay, have a look at this sentences one more time and think if you agree or disagree with them.

81
00:06:35,210 --> 00:06:37,150
All right, let's recap.

82
00:06:37,160 --> 00:06:41,030
We use many and few with countable nouns.

83
00:06:41,030 --> 00:06:52,640
Many users, few users little, much with uncountable little money, much knowledge, a lot of some

84
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:56,060
with countable and uncountable nouns.

85
00:06:56,090 --> 00:07:00,110
A lot of businesses, some knowledge.

86
